 *    _MM_MANT_NORM_p5_1    // interval [0.5, 1)
 *    _MM_MANT_NORM_p75_1p5 // interval [0.75, 1.5)
 * The sign is determined by sc which can take the following values:
 *    _MM_MANT_SIGN_src     // sign = sign(src)
